WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:27.130
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:27.400 --> 01:34.950
[The Great Long March]

3
01:35.330 --> 01:37.810
[Episode 51]

4
01:39.479 --> 01:40.560
Comrade Guotao.

5
01:42.039 --> 01:43.310
What's your opinion?

6
02:00.710 --> 02:02.560
Why not fight a battle

7
02:06.560 --> 02:08.210
to settle the matter?

8
02:12.530 --> 02:16.050
[Dongcun, Fu County, Shaanxi]

9
02:39.150 --> 02:39.750
Chairman.

10
02:39.910 --> 02:41.510
Let me light the lamp for you.

11
02:42.030 --> 02:43.000
It's not completely dark yet.

12
02:43.000 --> 02:44.000
Wait a bit longer.

13
02:48.800 --> 02:50.560
Is there a trap set outside?

14
02:50.750 --> 02:52.400
I heard from the local fellow villagers.

15
02:52.400 --> 02:53.840
They said that once winter comes,

16
02:53.840 --> 02:54.680
there's no food in the mountains.

17
02:54.680 --> 02:56.550
Wild wolves will sneak into the village and hurt people.

18
02:56.550 --> 02:57.870
So I set up a trap. Once I hear a sound,

19
02:57.870 --> 02:59.870
I can hit its head with the wooden stick.

20
02:59.870 --> 03:01.150
So it's for wolves.

21
03:01.470 --> 03:02.360
Enlai.

22
03:02.680 --> 03:03.810
You are quite lucky.

23
03:03.910 --> 03:05.470
Fortunately, Changfeng was in the room.

24
03:05.470 --> 03:06.390
If he were outside,

25
03:06.390 --> 03:07.790
you would be in danger.

26
03:09.130 --> 03:10.170
Comrade Zedong.

27
03:10.630 --> 03:12.290
A telegram from Zhang Guotao.

28
03:12.400 --> 03:12.800
Changfeng.

29
03:12.800 --> 03:13.660
Light the lamp.

30
03:15.600 --> 03:16.390
I'll do it.

31
03:21.800 --> 03:23.190
This time, Zhang Guotao

32
03:23.560 --> 03:25.520
seems determined to go south.

33
03:27.630 --> 03:28.840
And in this telegram,

34
03:29.360 --> 03:31.360
there are two details worth noting.

35
03:31.750 --> 03:32.520
First,

36
03:32.870 --> 03:33.960
in the header,

37
03:34.240 --> 03:36.500
he didn't call us the Central Committee,

38
03:36.560 --> 03:39.960
but used Mao, Zhang, Zhou, Wang, and Bo instead.

39
03:40.079 --> 03:41.360
The second detail is that

40
03:41.360 --> 03:45.079
he informed us of the details of the battle plan

41
03:45.100 --> 03:48.030
to attack Ya'an, Mingshan, Qionglai, and Dayi,

42
03:48.240 --> 03:49.560
and emphasized them.

43
03:49.630 --> 03:51.750
This has never happened before.

44
03:56.010 --> 03:57.110
He didn't call us the Central Committee.

45
03:57.110 --> 03:58.770
I'm afraid he has other ideas.

46
03:59.240 --> 04:00.640
As for the second detail,

47
04:00.910 --> 04:03.960
he just wants to strike back at us.

48
04:04.850 --> 04:06.310
Strike back at us for what?

49
04:07.000 --> 04:08.030
In late June,

50
04:08.510 --> 04:10.150
in order to win him over to go north,

51
04:10.150 --> 04:12.480
we formulated the Songpan Campaign Plan.

52
04:12.990 --> 04:14.910
We mentioned in the reply to him that

53
04:14.910 --> 04:16.190
going south is a dead end.

54
04:16.190 --> 04:17.360
He is not convinced

55
04:17.399 --> 04:18.589
and wants to show us.

56
04:20.269 --> 04:21.110
Zhang Guotao is

57
04:21.110 --> 04:22.930
determined to go his own way.

58
04:25.830 --> 04:27.040
To be honest,

59
04:28.700 --> 04:30.530
I actually hope Zhang Guotao

60
04:31.430 --> 04:33.110
can break through this wall.

61
04:33.930 --> 04:35.590
If he really wins this battle,

62
04:35.750 --> 04:38.550
it won't be a bad thing for the Chinese revolution.

63
04:39.950 --> 04:41.040
It's a pity.

64
04:41.780 --> 04:43.310
Zhang Guotao can't understand

65
04:43.310 --> 04:46.170
the painstaking efforts of our Central Committee.

66
04:54.860 --> 05:01.600
[Feng Yuxiang's Residence, Nanjing]

67
05:01.260 --> 05:01.830
Report!

68
05:02.000 --> 05:04.660
Deputy Commander-in-Chief Zhang has arrived.

69
05:08.820 --> 05:10.350
[Zhang Xueliang, Acting Commander-in-Chief of the Northwestern Bandit-Suppression Headquarters of the KMT Troops]

70
05:11.920 --> 05:12.600
Hanqing.

71
05:12.800 --> 05:13.560
You're here.

72
05:13.920 --> 05:14.800
Uncle.

73
05:15.520 --> 05:16.550
You call me uncle.

74
05:16.460 --> 05:20.420
[Feng Yuxiang, Patriotic General and Member of the Kuomintang Central Executive Committee]

75
05:16.800 --> 05:18.400
"Uncle" is too much, surely.

76
05:18.520 --> 05:20.920
We've both sworn brotherhood with Chiang.

77
05:21.040 --> 05:22.360
You are his sworn younger brother,

78
05:22.360 --> 05:23.950
and I am his sworn elder brother.

79
05:23.950 --> 05:26.160
That makes us equals.

80
05:26.310 --> 05:27.430
He has his way,

81
05:27.450 --> 05:28.450
and we have ours.

82
05:28.550 --> 05:30.110
I must call you uncle.

83
05:31.380 --> 05:32.460
Come, Hanqing.

84
05:32.920 --> 05:34.159
In terms of age,

85
05:34.180 --> 05:35.580
you should call me uncle.

86
05:35.770 --> 05:37.330
The brothers in my army

87
05:37.360 --> 05:38.630
all call me Brother Feng.

88
05:38.630 --> 05:40.340
Why don't you call me Brother, then?

89
05:40.340 --> 05:41.130
As you wish,

90
05:41.159 --> 05:42.250
Brother.

91
05:46.150 --> 05:47.270
Hanqing.

92
05:47.750 --> 05:49.360
Look at this fancy cage

93
05:49.360 --> 05:50.800
Chiang has given me.

94
05:50.990 --> 05:52.550
All these soft, flimsy things

95
05:52.550 --> 05:53.920
with legs and feet.

96
05:53.940 --> 05:56.740
I can hardly sit on them without feeling restless.

97
05:56.930 --> 05:58.550
We old soldiers feel much more at ease

98
05:58.550 --> 06:00.160
sitting on the bare ground.

99
06:00.180 --> 06:01.510
Food even tastes better

100
06:01.690 --> 06:03.170
that way.

101
06:03.270 --> 06:04.530
You don't mind, do you?

102
06:04.600 --> 06:06.430
I'm also from the military.

103
06:06.880 --> 06:08.190
Sitting on the ground

104
06:08.210 --> 06:09.810
makes the food taste better.

105
06:10.600 --> 06:11.080
Good.

106
06:11.720 --> 06:14.120
Bring another set of bowls and chopsticks.

107
06:16.870 --> 06:17.790
Hanqing,

108
06:18.070 --> 06:19.720
as a young marshal,

109
06:19.990 --> 06:22.430
is this your first time eating on the ground?

110
06:22.430 --> 06:23.160
It's great.

111
06:25.070 --> 06:25.630
Come,

112
06:25.740 --> 06:26.800
dip it in the sauce.

113
06:36.159 --> 06:38.120
You don't look well.

114
06:38.390 --> 06:40.120
What happened?

115
06:40.390 --> 06:41.830
Today,

116
06:43.600 --> 06:45.400
I suffered a great humiliation.

117
06:45.430 --> 06:46.340
What happened?

118
06:47.830 --> 06:49.490
At the Kuomintang symposium,

119
06:49.770 --> 06:51.060
it was my turn to speak.

120
06:51.600 --> 06:53.400
I went on stage and proposed that

121
06:54.000 --> 06:56.040
several provinces are suffering from severe drought

122
06:56.040 --> 06:57.240
and there are many victims.

123
06:57.240 --> 06:59.190
We should advocate not hosting banquets for each other

124
06:59.190 --> 07:01.750
and use the money saved to help disaster victims.

125
07:01.750 --> 07:03.190
Before I could finish my words,

126
07:03.190 --> 07:05.600
the audience started mocking and jeering.

127
07:06.040 --> 07:07.760
I even heard someone scolding me.

128
07:07.760 --> 07:08.800
What did they say?

129
07:09.530 --> 07:12.800
How can a non-resistance general like you have the right to speak?

130
07:12.800 --> 07:14.040
Outrageous.

131
07:22.270 --> 07:23.040
Report.

132
07:23.310 --> 07:24.000
Speak.

133
07:24.240 --> 07:25.040
Generalissimo,

134
07:25.040 --> 07:27.840
Zhang Xueliang went to Feng Yuxiang's residence.

135
07:33.970 --> 07:35.500
Look at this Zhang Hanqing.

136
07:35.720 --> 07:37.980
He is so worrisome.

137
07:38.800 --> 07:41.159
In broad daylight,

138
07:41.320 --> 07:43.400
so many people jeered at him.

139
07:43.560 --> 07:44.620
That's also wrong.

140
07:52.270 --> 07:53.560
Why did they jeer at him?

141
07:53.560 --> 07:55.830
That's because he doesn't know

142
07:55.950 --> 07:57.430
his place.

143
07:57.560 --> 07:58.490
Lie down.

144
07:58.790 --> 08:00.400
You have no idea.

145
08:00.510 --> 08:01.510
His Northeastern Army

146
08:01.510 --> 08:03.040
has been dragging its feet

147
08:03.070 --> 08:05.430
near the Shaanxi-Gansu border for nearly half a month.

148
08:05.430 --> 08:08.160
The Communist Army has been attacking Ganquan for days,

149
08:08.160 --> 08:10.190
and he just sits there and does nothing.

150
08:10.190 --> 08:10.800
Right?

151
08:10.920 --> 08:12.920
With this kind of thing, I...

152
08:12.950 --> 08:14.070
Lie down. Lie down.

153
08:14.490 --> 08:15.880
He is in Nanjing.

154
08:16.160 --> 08:19.310
If you order him to advance as soon as possible,

155
08:19.430 --> 08:21.240
would he dare to disobey?

156
08:33.150 --> 08:34.080
Call Qian Dajun over.

157
08:34.080 --> 08:34.600
Yes.

158
08:34.720 --> 08:35.760
Doesn't your tooth hurt?

159
08:35.760 --> 08:38.070
Toothache is nothing compared to heartache.

160
08:38.070 --> 08:38.929
I'll stop here.

161
08:39.080 --> 08:40.890
Send a telegram to Zhurong (Yan Daogang).

162
08:40.890 --> 08:43.490
If he doesn't move, someone will help him move.

163
08:45.000 --> 08:47.000
After the September 18th Incident,

164
08:47.200 --> 08:49.080
I was disheartened for a while.

165
08:49.230 --> 08:52.580
But whenever I thought of the humiliation of our country

166
08:53.910 --> 08:56.840
and the suffering of our people, my heart would ache.

167
08:57.450 --> 08:59.090
I was so furious that I wanted to grab a bayonet

168
08:59.090 --> 09:00.820
and fight the Japanese myself.

169
09:00.870 --> 09:03.270
Better to die fighting than live like this.

170
09:03.960 --> 09:05.360
In 1933,

171
09:05.570 --> 09:07.570
I resigned from all my posts

172
09:07.600 --> 09:09.200
and traveled around Europe.

173
09:09.360 --> 09:11.490
At that time, I wondered whether China

174
09:11.630 --> 09:13.960
should follow the example of Germany and Italy

175
09:13.960 --> 09:15.480
and adopt fascism.

176
09:15.720 --> 09:17.910
Perhaps we needed a strong leader

177
09:18.000 --> 09:20.280
like Mussolini or Hitler

178
09:21.000 --> 09:23.130
to establish an authoritarian state,

179
09:23.330 --> 09:24.120
unite the nation's strength,

180
09:24.120 --> 09:25.360
drive out foreign aggressors,

181
09:25.360 --> 09:27.390
and restore our country.

182
09:28.200 --> 09:29.360
So,

183
09:30.000 --> 09:31.710
you chose Chiang Kai-shek.

184
09:36.310 --> 09:37.230
Yes.

185
09:39.790 --> 09:40.720
It's a pity.

186
09:41.080 --> 09:42.610
He disappointed me so much.

187
09:43.080 --> 09:44.840
He was determined

188
09:45.600 --> 09:47.360
to pacify the country before resisting foreign aggression,

189
09:47.360 --> 09:50.090
constantly making concessions to the Japanese.

190
09:50.630 --> 09:52.030
He used the campaigns against the Red Army

191
09:52.030 --> 09:55.080
to set us against them, hoping we'd destroy each other.

192
09:55.080 --> 09:58.020
He wanted my more than 100,000 Northeastern Army troops

193
09:58.020 --> 09:59.690
to fight the Red Army

194
09:59.720 --> 10:01.580
until both sides were decimated.

195
10:01.580 --> 10:03.550
In the two recent battles in northern Shaanxi,

196
10:03.550 --> 10:05.670
the 110th Division suffered heavy losses,

197
10:05.670 --> 10:06.960
as did part of the 107th Division.

198
10:06.960 --> 10:07.810
And what did he do?

199
10:07.810 --> 10:10.410
Not only did he refuse to send reinforcements,

200
10:10.900 --> 10:13.730
he actually disbanded the 110th Division.

201
10:16.540 --> 10:18.670
Our understanding of Chiang Kai-shek

202
10:19.460 --> 10:20.700
is the same.

203
10:21.490 --> 10:23.390
The Japanese are now using the so-called

204
10:23.390 --> 10:24.910
"Autonomy of North China"

205
10:25.240 --> 10:28.720
as a pretext to pursue their ultimate goal of invading all of China.

206
10:28.720 --> 10:31.510
Their wild ambition is known to everyone.

207
10:31.780 --> 10:34.420
But Chiang Kai-shek is playing dumb.

208
10:34.600 --> 10:36.390
He even wants to set up some

209
10:36.670 --> 10:38.760
Hebei-Chahar Political Council

210
10:38.950 --> 10:40.750
to compromise with Japan again.

211
10:42.290 --> 10:44.740
Expecting him to actively resist Japan

212
10:45.760 --> 10:48.530
is an illusion.

213
10:50.910 --> 10:51.670
Brother,

214
10:53.270 --> 10:54.630
please tell me,

215
10:55.080 --> 10:56.600
what should I do?

216
10:59.110 --> 11:01.170
During the September 18th Incident,

217
11:01.210 --> 11:03.660
you already got a terrible reputation.

218
11:03.720 --> 11:04.630
Now,

219
11:05.410 --> 11:07.810
you must not repeat the same mistake.

220
11:11.170 --> 11:12.790
Do you mean northern Shaanxi?

221
11:12.790 --> 11:14.710
Chiang Kai-shek has spent years

222
11:14.730 --> 11:17.060
pursuing the Red Army from south to north.

223
11:17.300 --> 11:18.990
And has he wiped them out?

224
11:19.350 --> 11:20.750
I can assert that

225
11:21.060 --> 11:22.790
if you continue to listen to him

226
11:22.800 --> 11:24.510
and fight the Red Army to the death,

227
11:24.510 --> 11:27.170
the one who falls in the end will definitely not be the Red Army,

228
11:27.170 --> 11:28.970
but you, Zhang Hanqing.

229
11:29.480 --> 11:31.440
I'm not being an alarmist.

230
11:31.670 --> 11:32.790
Think about it.

231
11:33.080 --> 11:35.010
Why can't the Red Army be wiped out?

232
11:35.180 --> 11:37.270
Because they have the people's support.

233
11:37.270 --> 11:40.080
Then what is the Red Army doing in northern Shaanxi now?

234
11:40.080 --> 11:42.390
Their banner is to resist Japan.

235
11:43.000 --> 11:44.200
Nowadays,

236
11:44.320 --> 11:45.510
the call to resist Japanese aggression is no longer

237
11:45.510 --> 11:47.770
coming from just one person or one party.

238
11:47.910 --> 11:50.440
With the situation in North China so perilous,

239
11:50.440 --> 11:52.130
resistance against Japan has become the prevailing tide

240
11:52.130 --> 11:53.590
and the will of the people.

241
11:53.720 --> 11:55.780
In all my years as a military commander,

242
11:55.780 --> 11:58.350
the best thing I've ever done

243
11:58.380 --> 11:59.680
was to organize

244
11:59.710 --> 12:01.630
the Chahar People's Anti-Japanese Army two years ago

245
12:01.630 --> 12:03.690
and fight the Japanese tooth and nail.

246
12:03.690 --> 12:05.520
I heard that in this Anti-Japanese Army,

247
12:05.520 --> 12:06.930
there were Communists.

248
12:06.950 --> 12:09.880
There were indeed a number of Communists in the Army.

249
12:10.320 --> 12:12.830
Xie Zichang, who was known as a leader of the Communist Army

250
12:12.830 --> 12:14.890
in northern Shaanxi, was one of them.

251
12:15.240 --> 12:18.280
Even my Commander-in-Chief at the front, Ji Hongchang,

252
12:18.280 --> 12:19.620
was a Communist.

253
12:20.960 --> 12:21.910
Unfortunately,

254
12:22.000 --> 12:22.630
he was killed by

255
12:22.630 --> 12:24.940
our sworn brother, Chiang.

256
12:25.690 --> 12:28.160
Ji Hongchang was one of my brave generals.

257
12:29.650 --> 12:30.840
He was so tall,

258
12:31.040 --> 12:32.760
like an iron tower.

259
12:33.380 --> 12:35.170
When he was executed,

260
12:35.550 --> 12:38.750
he used a twig to write a poem on the ground:

261
12:39.360 --> 12:41.760
"I regret not dying fighting the Japanese,

262
12:41.790 --> 12:43.500
That is my shame today.

263
12:44.310 --> 12:45.920
With our country in ruins,

264
12:46.600 --> 12:48.520
why should I spare my own life?"

265
12:49.920 --> 12:51.130
He said,

266
12:51.600 --> 12:55.150
"A Communist must die with honor and dignity."

267
12:55.550 --> 12:57.030
He sat on a chair,

268
12:57.120 --> 13:00.180
staring at the executioner's gun when he was executed.

269
13:02.740 --> 13:05.030
But the Communist Party is just formidable.

270
13:05.030 --> 13:06.930
They're the ones organizing resistance

271
13:06.930 --> 13:09.330
against the Japanese in the Northeast now.

272
13:18.790 --> 13:20.650
I heard that more than a month ago,

273
13:21.240 --> 13:22.870
an open telegram titled "An Appeal to Military and Political Leaders

274
13:22.870 --> 13:25.550
in China Proper from the Northeast Anti-Japanese Allied Army" was issued.

275
13:25.550 --> 13:26.550
It was signed by

276
13:26.570 --> 13:29.120
several commanders of the Northeast People's Revolutionary Army:

277
13:29.120 --> 13:31.000
Yang Jingyu, Wang Detai,

278
13:31.170 --> 13:32.770
Zhao Shangzhi, Li Yanlu,

279
13:32.800 --> 13:33.920
and Zhou Baozhong.

280
13:34.120 --> 13:37.050
They are all members of the Communist Party of China.

281
13:37.550 --> 13:39.030
The telegram stated:

282
13:40.080 --> 13:42.550
"We have fought bitterly for four long years.

283
13:42.550 --> 13:45.410
Every day, we await reinforcements from the rest of China and fight the Japanese.

284
13:45.410 --> 13:48.270
Yet to this day, not a single soldier has been sent."

285
13:54.320 --> 13:55.550
I...

286
13:59.550 --> 14:01.030
The land I lost,

287
14:03.200 --> 14:05.880
I have to let others guard it for me.

288
14:06.810 --> 14:08.720
My people hope I will fight back,

289
14:10.030 --> 14:11.550
but I can't go back.

290
14:14.520 --> 14:16.120
I'm too ashamed to face them.

291
14:34.060 --> 14:35.180
Hanqing,

292
14:35.650 --> 14:37.040
after doing this for so many years,

293
14:37.040 --> 14:38.400
I gradually realized.

294
14:38.600 --> 14:40.800
The key to commanding troops is knowing

295
14:41.030 --> 14:42.480
which battles to fight

296
14:42.720 --> 14:44.200
and which to avoid.

297
14:44.480 --> 14:45.790
Fail to fight a battle you should have fought,

298
14:45.790 --> 14:47.250
and you'll earn a bad name.

299
14:47.320 --> 14:49.940
Fight one you shouldn't,

300
14:51.200 --> 14:53.030
and you'll earn a bad name all the same.

301
14:53.030 --> 14:55.080
The infamy you bear then

302
14:55.100 --> 14:56.650
will probably be ten or a hundred times worse

303
14:56.650 --> 14:58.580
than the September 18th Incident.

304
14:58.710 --> 15:00.830
In the end, you might not even be able to command

305
15:00.830 --> 15:02.740
your own soldiers and generals.

306
15:12.870 --> 15:13.840
Brother.

307
15:14.240 --> 15:15.790
Your words

308
15:16.310 --> 15:18.190
have enlightened me.

309
15:19.030 --> 15:21.050
I will seriously consider

310
15:21.870 --> 15:23.870
what course to follow when I go back.

311
15:30.490 --> 15:31.470
Zhang Hanqing.

312
15:32.300 --> 15:35.040
You are once again at the center of the storm.

313
15:42.000 --> 15:43.870
You must act prudently.

314
15:44.150 --> 15:45.870
All your guidance,

315
15:46.870 --> 15:48.320
I remember it well.

316
15:49.030 --> 15:51.320
That year when I toasted you,

317
15:51.930 --> 15:53.720
you said two things to me.

318
15:54.750 --> 15:56.850
Alcohol ruins things.

319
15:57.270 --> 15:59.720
You must be self-disciplined.

320
16:01.670 --> 16:04.070
I will always remember these two things.

321
16:07.170 --> 16:12.950
[Xiangbizaiwan, Ganquan County, Shaanxi]

322
16:18.660 --> 16:20.320
Hurry.

323
16:21.660 --> 16:22.450
What's going on?

324
16:22.450 --> 16:23.700
C...Chief of Staff Ye.

325
16:23.700 --> 16:25.230
I thought it was a wild wolf.

326
16:27.270 --> 16:27.840
Chairman Mao.

327
16:27.840 --> 16:28.480
Jianying.

328
16:28.870 --> 16:30.130
Report from the front.

329
16:30.330 --> 16:32.170
Dong Yingbin left one division to guard Taibai Town.

330
16:32.170 --> 16:33.030
The remaining main force

331
16:33.030 --> 16:35.630
has advanced east along the Hulu River Valley.

332
16:36.200 --> 16:37.600
The wolf is finally here.

333
16:37.750 --> 16:38.990
What's Peng's plan?

334
16:39.170 --> 16:40.520
There's a good place for an ambush.

335
16:40.520 --> 16:41.850
It's a must-pass for the Northeastern Army,

336
16:41.850 --> 16:42.910
called Zhiluo Town.

337
16:42.910 --> 16:43.790
Zhiluo Town.

338
16:43.870 --> 16:44.630
Good.

339
16:44.840 --> 16:46.130
Let's go check the terrain.

340
16:46.130 --> 16:46.800
Good.

341
16:53.970 --> 16:54.720
Chairman.

342
16:58.260 --> 16:59.690
Just as the long-awaited opportunity

343
16:59.690 --> 17:01.240
finally came for the Red Army

344
17:01.240 --> 17:02.970
in northern Shaanxi,

345
17:03.870 --> 17:05.750
the 4th Front Army heading south

346
17:05.770 --> 17:07.920
launched the Battle of Baizhangguan.

347
17:09.310 --> 17:10.829
On November 13,

348
17:11.170 --> 17:12.200
the 4th Front Army

349
17:12.230 --> 17:14.030
deployed a total of 15 regiments

350
17:14.369 --> 17:17.849
to attack the enemy at Zhujiachang and Taihechang.

351
17:19.480 --> 17:22.599
After capturing the Baizhangguan area at dawn on the 16th,

352
17:22.140 --> 17:26.250
[Baizhangguan, Mingshan County, Sichuan]

353
17:22.770 --> 17:24.720
the offensive was soon thwarted.

354
17:26.329 --> 17:28.240
At dawn on November 19,

355
17:28.349 --> 17:30.290
under the cover of planes and artillery,

356
17:30.290 --> 17:33.530
the Sichuan Army launched repeated mass assaults

357
17:33.720 --> 17:36.080
on Red Army positions from the north, east, and south,

358
17:36.080 --> 17:39.290
with entire companies and battalions advancing at a time.

359
17:39.290 --> 17:41.160
The officers and soldiers of the 4th Front Army,

360
17:41.160 --> 17:42.480
despite extreme exhaustion

361
17:42.480 --> 17:44.920
and a severe shortage of ammunition,

362
17:45.180 --> 17:48.070
fought the enemy in a desperate battle to the death.

363
18:37.530 --> 18:39.890
[Zhang Side, Soldier of the 4th Front Army]

364
18:38.090 --> 18:39.110
Company Commander.

365
18:39.110 --> 18:40.110
One wave goes down,

366
18:40.110 --> 18:41.290
another comes right back.

367
18:41.290 --> 18:43.020
Damn it, they just keep coming.

368
18:43.420 --> 18:44.350
It's so strange.

369
18:44.680 --> 18:46.680
The Sichuan Army used to run at the first strike.

370
18:46.680 --> 18:48.770
Today is really weird.

371
18:48.790 --> 18:49.870
Fire!

372
19:36.150 --> 19:38.740
[The 4th Front Army Headquarters, Mount Mengding, Sichuan]

373
19:38.970 --> 19:41.340
Here. Good.

374
19:42.130 --> 19:43.170
I got it.

375
19:45.520 --> 19:46.400
Reports from the front.

376
19:46.400 --> 19:47.460
At least seven Sichuan Army brigades

377
19:47.460 --> 19:49.720
have reinforced the enemy's front line.

378
19:52.680 --> 19:53.330
Here.

379
19:53.720 --> 19:54.440
Here.

380
19:54.460 --> 19:55.220
And here.

381
19:55.480 --> 19:57.220
They've established defense in depth

382
19:57.220 --> 19:58.590
along the line from Baitangguan to Qionglai.

383
19:58.590 --> 20:00.640
The enemy at Heizhuguan is also constantly counterattacking.

384
20:00.640 --> 20:02.330
We can no longer attack towards Qionglai.

385
20:02.330 --> 20:03.680
The flanks are unprotected.

386
20:03.680 --> 20:05.240
It is too disadvantageous for us.

387
20:05.240 --> 20:06.130
Order the main force

388
20:06.130 --> 20:07.930
to concentrate on Baitangguan.

389
20:08.170 --> 20:09.170
Use the terrain to

390
20:09.240 --> 20:10.970
ambush enemy reinforcements.

391
20:11.140 --> 20:12.640
We must take Baizhangguan.

392
20:12.640 --> 20:13.670
We cannot retreat a single step.

393
20:13.670 --> 20:14.390
Yes.

394
20:14.540 --> 20:19.140
[Nanjing, Jiangsu]

395
20:15.550 --> 20:16.310
In short,

396
20:16.500 --> 20:18.450
the government's foreign policy,

397
20:18.590 --> 20:21.370
in line with the nation's desire for self-preservation at home

398
20:21.370 --> 20:23.850
and peaceful coexistence abroad, is this:

399
20:23.880 --> 20:26.190
as long as there is still hope for peace,

400
20:26.550 --> 20:28.400
we must never abandon it.

401
20:28.830 --> 20:31.240
And unless we have reached the final moment,

402
20:31.240 --> 20:33.640
we must never resort to sacrifice lightly.

403
20:33.750 --> 20:34.750
Of course,

404
20:34.920 --> 20:36.720
peace has its limits,

405
20:36.880 --> 20:39.000
and sacrifice requires determination.

406
20:39.000 --> 20:41.070
If the limits of peace are exceeded,

407
20:41.280 --> 20:43.520
we can only obey the Party

408
20:43.830 --> 20:45.920
and make the final decision.

409
20:46.440 --> 20:47.360
That's all!

410
21:02.380 --> 21:03.100
Hanqing.

411
21:06.070 --> 21:06.960
Brother.

412
21:07.350 --> 21:08.880
I really want to ask him

413
21:09.680 --> 21:11.400
what kind of limit

414
21:11.420 --> 21:13.180
exceeds the limit of peace.

415
21:13.640 --> 21:16.300
Let's listen to his words and watch his actions.

416
21:16.710 --> 21:17.430
Brother.

417
21:17.460 --> 21:18.590
Hanqing.

418
21:21.590 --> 21:22.460
Generalissimo.

419
21:22.460 --> 21:23.390
Generalissimo.

420
21:23.450 --> 21:26.210
I heard you and Hanqing spent some time

421
21:26.630 --> 21:30.220
talking late into the night a few days ago,

422
21:30.240 --> 21:31.640
sitting on the floor together.

423
21:31.640 --> 21:32.830
How was the food?

424
21:33.530 --> 21:35.060
And what did you talk about?

425
21:37.340 --> 21:38.220
Generalissimo.

426
21:38.220 --> 21:40.300
You are really considerate,

427
21:40.320 --> 21:41.660
attentive to every detail,

428
21:41.660 --> 21:43.320
and observant of everything.

429
21:43.960 --> 21:44.670
Report.

430
21:45.960 --> 21:46.850
Generalissimo.

431
21:46.850 --> 21:48.780
An urgent telegram from Liu Xiang.

432
21:49.840 --> 21:50.360
Speak.

433
21:50.380 --> 21:51.180
Yes.

434
21:51.630 --> 21:52.240
Currently,

435
21:52.110 --> 21:54.410
[Qian Dajun, Director of the First Department, Chairman's Office, Military Affairs Commission of the Nationalist Government]

436
21:52.270 --> 21:54.520
the Sichuan Army is fighting a decisive battle

437
21:54.520 --> 21:57.480
with the Communist Army heading south at Baizhangguan.

438
21:57.480 --> 21:58.720
Reply to Liu Xiang.

439
21:59.070 --> 22:01.680
We support his decisive battle with the Communist Army.

440
22:01.680 --> 22:03.050
I will immediately dispatch troops

441
22:03.050 --> 22:04.130
to support him.

442
22:04.360 --> 22:04.880
Yes.

443
22:06.370 --> 22:07.300
Brothers,

444
22:07.720 --> 22:09.120
I'll take my leave first.

445
22:13.830 --> 22:14.540
Generalissimo.

446
22:14.540 --> 22:15.860
I'll take my leave too.

447
22:16.560 --> 22:17.400
Brother,

448
22:18.000 --> 22:19.300
you've been working hard

449
22:19.300 --> 22:20.440
with meetings for several days.

450
22:20.440 --> 22:22.510
You invited me to discuss state affairs.

451
22:22.510 --> 22:23.880
It's not hard work.

452
22:24.150 --> 22:25.830
Your speech just now was very good.

453
22:25.830 --> 22:27.400
I came to Nanjing this time

454
22:27.420 --> 22:29.220
to resist Japan.

455
22:29.380 --> 22:30.470
Otherwise,

456
22:30.850 --> 22:32.050
I wouldn't have come.

457
22:33.100 --> 22:34.660
The current situation in North China

458
22:34.660 --> 22:36.240
has probably already exceeded

459
22:36.240 --> 22:37.930
the limit of peace.

460
22:38.200 --> 22:40.040
Hanqing and the rest of us

461
22:40.070 --> 22:42.470
are all waiting for you to make up your mind.

462
22:42.500 --> 22:43.700
That's good.

463
22:44.400 --> 22:46.940
We'll all follow the orders of the Party and the nation together.

464
22:46.940 --> 22:47.590
Good.

465
22:48.280 --> 22:50.080
I hope this day won't be too long.

466
22:50.240 --> 22:51.200
Otherwise,

467
22:51.230 --> 22:53.130
we'll lose the people's support and the loyalty of the troops,

468
22:53.130 --> 22:55.540
and the Party will lose its legitimacy.

469
22:55.700 --> 22:56.630
Rest assured.

470
22:56.830 --> 22:58.110
With your support,

471
22:58.130 --> 23:00.320
I will surely succeed.

472
23:03.420 --> 23:04.220
By the way,

473
23:04.720 --> 23:06.640
do you remember what I wrote in my oath of brotherhood

474
23:06.640 --> 23:08.400
when we became sworn brothers?

475
23:10.240 --> 23:11.550
Of course I remember.

476
23:11.920 --> 23:13.830
You wrote it yourself:

477
23:13.850 --> 23:17.680
"The true purpose of our brotherhood is to serve the cause."

478
23:18.270 --> 23:18.960
Right?

479
23:20.390 --> 23:21.390
So,

480
23:21.560 --> 23:23.070
I became your sworn brother

481
23:23.070 --> 23:24.330
not for personal gain,

482
23:24.580 --> 23:27.580
but for Sun Yat-sen's Three Principles of the People.

483
23:27.790 --> 23:30.270
Let's encourage each other.

484
23:51.830 --> 23:52.760
Generalissimo.

485
23:54.070 --> 23:55.730
Mr. Huanzhang (Feng Yuxiang)

486
23:55.780 --> 23:57.450
looks rather lonely.

487
23:57.960 --> 23:59.960
He's not lonely at all.

488
24:00.460 --> 24:02.570
He's just good at maneuvering.

489
24:05.510 --> 24:07.110
What's going on with Zurong(Yan Daogang)?

490
24:07.110 --> 24:08.530
He has already followed your orders

491
24:08.530 --> 24:11.640
and urged Dong Yingbin's troops to speed up their eastward advance.

492
24:11.640 --> 24:12.380
Very good.

493
24:21.350 --> 24:22.960
While the 1st Front Red Army

494
24:22.980 --> 24:24.630
was hiding near Zhiluo Town,

495
24:24.660 --> 24:26.720
waiting for an opportunity to fight,

496
24:26.830 --> 24:29.160
the 2nd and 6th Red Army Corps,

497
24:29.180 --> 24:31.200
stationed in Sangzhi County, Hunan Province,

498
24:31.200 --> 24:33.140
decided to launch an immediate strategic shift

499
24:33.140 --> 24:36.420
in response to the grave enemy situation.

500
24:36.450 --> 24:38.510
In accordance with the resolution adopted

501
24:38.510 --> 24:42.270
at an earlier joint meeting of the Hunan-Hubei-Sichuan-Guizhou Provincial Party Committee

502
24:42.270 --> 24:44.790
and the Military Commission Sub-Committee in Liujiaping,

503
24:44.790 --> 24:46.390
they would advance toward the vast, unfortified areas

504
24:46.390 --> 24:48.110
around Shiqian, Zhenyuan,

505
24:48.130 --> 24:50.170
and Huangping in Guizhou.

506
24:50.830 --> 24:52.920
Their objectives were to preserve the Red Army's fighting strength,

507
24:52.920 --> 24:55.110
prepare for a counteroffensive,

508
24:55.350 --> 24:57.610
and establish a new revolutionary base.

509
24:58.400 --> 25:01.000
On November 19, 1935,

510
25:01.000 --> 25:02.550
the 2nd and 6th Red Army Corps

511
25:02.550 --> 25:04.350
set out from Liujiaping,

512
25:04.370 --> 25:06.040
Gantianba, Ruitapu,

513
25:06.070 --> 25:07.930
and Fengshuta in Sangzhi County,

514
25:07.980 --> 25:10.330
embarking on a long journey.

515
25:10.950 --> 25:19.850
[Hongjiaguan Village, Sangzhi County, Hunan]

516
25:37.000 --> 25:39.520
[Ren Bishi, Member of the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee; Political Commissar of the 2nd Red Army Corps]

517
25:38.590 --> 25:40.590
Aren't you going back to take a look?

518
25:40.770 --> 25:41.640
No.

519
25:42.530 --> 25:43.780
All my relatives

520
25:43.900 --> 25:46.980
[He Long, Corps Commander of the 2nd Red Army Corps]

521
25:44.550 --> 25:46.270
were killed by the enemy.

522
25:47.630 --> 25:49.220
I have nothing to say.

523
25:50.000 --> 25:51.070
I heard that

524
25:51.220 --> 25:53.620
after Comrade He Ying sacrificed herself,

525
25:53.770 --> 25:55.930
she was dismembered and displayed by the enemy.

526
25:55.930 --> 25:57.500
And your sister He Mangu,

527
25:57.850 --> 25:59.570
to protect the party's secrets,

528
25:59.570 --> 26:01.900
was cut alive by the enemy, piece by piece.

529
26:08.070 --> 26:09.030
Comrade He Long.

530
26:09.440 --> 26:11.350
Your entire He family has sacrificed so much

531
26:11.350 --> 26:13.350
to secure this revolutionary base.

532
26:13.840 --> 26:14.710
So,

533
26:15.360 --> 26:17.330
I will use a greater victory

534
26:18.200 --> 26:19.590
to repay them.

535
26:20.330 --> 26:21.400
They can

536
26:23.040 --> 26:24.670
never wipe us all out.

537
26:39.370 --> 26:40.370
Uncle.

538
26:41.370 --> 26:42.800
Boy, you're here.

539
26:43.530 --> 26:44.730
Do you still remember

540
26:44.900 --> 26:46.800
what your aunt said to you

541
26:46.820 --> 26:48.250
before she sacrificed herself?

542
26:48.120 --> 26:50.990
[Xiang Xuan, Red Army soldier and He Long's nephew]

543
26:48.510 --> 26:49.270
I remember.

544
26:49.430 --> 26:51.430
Aunt told me to find you,

545
26:51.590 --> 26:52.790
join the Red Army,

546
26:52.830 --> 26:55.380
and seek justice for my mother and aunt.

547
26:57.720 --> 26:58.510
Xiang Xuan.

548
26:58.680 --> 27:00.570
Now that you've put on this uniform,

549
27:00.570 --> 27:03.880
you've become a Red Army soldier.

550
27:06.370 --> 27:07.370
I promise you.

551
27:07.460 --> 27:09.450
We will not only seek justice for your mother

552
27:09.450 --> 27:11.140
and aunt,

553
27:11.310 --> 27:12.730
but we will also seek justice for those

554
27:12.730 --> 27:15.580
brothers, sisters,

555
27:15.810 --> 27:17.960
and all people killed by the enemy.

556
27:22.290 --> 27:23.400
Uncle.

557
27:23.810 --> 27:25.560
Will we come back?

558
27:28.160 --> 27:28.950
Yes.

559
27:29.510 --> 27:31.030
After we defeat the Kuomintang

560
27:31.030 --> 27:32.590
and Japan,

561
27:33.270 --> 27:34.930
we will definitely come back.

562
27:38.660 --> 27:39.350
Let's go.

563
28:00.550 --> 28:01.810
Commander-in-Chief.

564
28:02.110 --> 28:03.510
The enemy has retreated.

565
28:03.790 --> 28:04.980
According to preliminary statistics,

566
28:04.980 --> 28:06.790
we killed over 15,000 enemy troops

567
28:06.790 --> 28:09.350
and suffered nearly 10,000 casualties.

568
28:09.470 --> 28:12.500
Many main force companies were wiped out.

569
28:17.890 --> 28:20.470
On November 21, 1935,

570
28:20.840 --> 28:24.070
Xu Xiangqian sent a telegram to Zhang Guotao and Chen Changhao.

571
28:24.070 --> 28:26.590
Given the open terrain around Baizhangguan

572
28:26.830 --> 28:29.110
and the concentration of the Sichuan Army,

573
28:29.110 --> 28:31.240
the opportunity for the Red Army to continue annihilating the enemy

574
28:31.240 --> 28:32.550
has been lost.

575
28:32.830 --> 28:35.360
He therefore decided to abandon Baitangguan

576
28:35.730 --> 28:37.580
and withdraw the main force

577
28:37.610 --> 28:39.130
to the mountainous area along the Lianhua Mountain line,

578
28:39.130 --> 28:41.660
where they could use the terrain for defense.

579
28:41.750 --> 28:42.480
This brought

580
28:42.790 --> 28:45.540
the seven-day Battle of Baitangguan to an end,

581
28:46.290 --> 28:48.200
along with the 4th Front Army's

582
28:48.310 --> 28:49.280
campaign across

583
28:49.310 --> 28:50.400
Tianquan, Lushan,

584
28:50.400 --> 28:52.310
Mingshan, Ya'an,

585
28:52.330 --> 28:53.720
Qionglai, and Dayi.

586
28:54.120 --> 28:56.800
The Baizhangguan Battle was the turning point

587
28:56.820 --> 29:00.050
for the southward Red Army from offense to defense.

588
29:00.840 --> 29:02.560
On the same day,

589
29:02.580 --> 29:04.720
more than a thousand kilometers away in the north,

590
29:04.720 --> 29:06.520
the Battle of Zhiluo Town began.

591
29:07.320 --> 29:09.070
According to Mao Zedong's order,

592
29:09.070 --> 29:11.860
the 1st and 15th Red Army Corps

593
29:12.160 --> 29:14.110
launched simultaneous assaults on the 109th Division

594
29:14.110 --> 29:16.930
of the Northeastern Army stationed in Zhiluo Town,

595
29:16.930 --> 29:19.260
attacking from the north and south.

596
29:20.130 --> 29:22.020
By 2:00 p.m.,

597
29:22.050 --> 29:24.250
most of the division had been wiped out.

598
29:24.400 --> 29:26.640
Mao Zedong decisively changed the deployment.

599
29:26.640 --> 29:28.830
The 1st Red Army Corps withdrew its main force

600
29:28.830 --> 29:31.200
and headed west to intercept the Kuomintang reinforcements,

601
29:31.200 --> 29:33.100
the 106th and 111th Divisions.

602
29:33.480 --> 29:36.410
The remaining 15th Red Army Corps continued to fight

603
29:36.640 --> 29:38.720
and finally wiped out the remaining enemy forces

604
29:38.720 --> 29:40.810
on November 24.

605
29:41.590 --> 29:42.450
In this battle,

606
29:42.550 --> 29:45.350
the Red Army annihilated the entire 109th Division

607
29:45.350 --> 29:46.810
and one additional regiment,

608
29:46.810 --> 29:50.070
killing over a thousand enemies including Division Commander Niu Yuanfeng,

609
29:50.070 --> 29:52.220
capturing 5,367 enemies,

610
29:52.740 --> 29:55.210
and seizing over 3,500 guns.

611
29:56.410 --> 29:57.750
The battle of Zhiluo Town

612
29:57.750 --> 29:59.760
effectively broke the Kuomintang army's

613
29:59.760 --> 30:02.440
third encirclement and suppression of the Shaanxi-Gansu Soviet Area,

614
30:02.440 --> 30:04.510
consolidated the Shaanxi-Gansu Soviet Area,

615
30:04.510 --> 30:05.780
and laid the foundation for the CPC Central Committee

616
30:05.780 --> 30:07.160
to establish the revolutionary headquarters

617
30:07.160 --> 30:09.720
in Shaanxi.

618
30:10.840 --> 30:11.750
At the same time,

619
30:11.750 --> 30:14.550
this campaign dealt a heavy blow to the Northeastern Army,

620
30:12.590 --> 30:14.410
[Liu Huaqing, Section Chief of Enemy Work Department, Political Department of the 15th Red Army Corps]

621
30:15.030 --> 30:17.290
prompting Zhang Xueliang and other Northeastern Army commanders

622
30:17.290 --> 30:20.570
to further recognize Chiang Kai-shek's ulterior motives.

623
30:20.570 --> 30:23.030
It also helped pave the way for the formation

624
30:23.030 --> 30:25.560
of the Anti-Japanese National United Front.

625
30:25.920 --> 30:26.920
After the battle,

626
30:27.240 --> 30:29.240
many captured Northeastern Army soldiers

627
30:29.240 --> 30:32.190
were inspired by the Red Army's spirit of going north to resist Japan

628
30:32.190 --> 30:34.160
and voluntarily joined the Red Army.

629
30:34.160 --> 30:34.760
Among them

630
30:35.070 --> 30:37.150
was a young man named Cui Rifa,

631
30:37.420 --> 30:39.790
who later changed his name to Cui Jiangong.

632
30:39.790 --> 30:40.750
17 years later,

633
30:40.920 --> 30:42.660
he commanded the Chinese People's Volunteer Army's

634
30:42.660 --> 30:44.570
45th Division of the 15th Corps

635
30:43.460 --> 30:45.750
[Cui Rifa, Northeastern Army soldier]

636
30:44.950 --> 30:48.020
and became famous in the Battle of Triangle Hill.

637
30:48.160 --> 30:51.880
He was awarded the rank of Major General in 1955.

638
30:53.050 --> 30:54.670
[Zhiluo Town, Shaanxi]

639
30:54.700 --> 30:59.690
Some mountains rise high,

640
30:59.800 --> 31:04.980
while others lie low.

641
31:05.000 --> 31:09.970
I'll make my way to Nanzhuang,

642
31:09.990 --> 31:13.220
just to see you once more.

643
31:16.590 --> 31:18.070
This battle of Zhiluo Town

644
31:18.510 --> 31:20.970
settled the situation in northern Shaanxi.

645
31:21.130 --> 31:23.740
We should send the news of this victory

646
31:24.270 --> 31:26.400
to the comrades of the 4th Front Army.

647
31:27.060 --> 31:28.650
I hope they can see

648
31:29.000 --> 31:30.910
that a new situation for the revolution in northern Shaanxi

649
31:30.910 --> 31:31.980
has been opened up.

650
31:32.130 --> 31:32.760
Good.

651
31:42.720 --> 31:43.260
Chairman Mao.

652
31:43.260 --> 31:44.390
Vice Chairman Zhou.

653
31:45.470 --> 31:47.530
A letter from Luofu (Zhang Wentian).

654
31:55.920 --> 31:57.480
What did Comrade Luofu say?

655
31:59.400 --> 32:00.750
Comrade Lin Yuying,

656
32:00.750 --> 32:02.480
the Comintern representative

657
32:02.620 --> 32:03.270
who used the alias Zhang Hao,

658
32:03.270 --> 32:04.600
has arrived in Wayaobu.

659
32:05.590 --> 32:06.440
He brought

660
32:06.640 --> 32:09.410
the resolutions and spirit of the Seventh Congress of the Communist International.

661
32:09.410 --> 32:10.210
That's great.

662
32:11.790 --> 32:14.170
Lin Yuying also mentioned that Comrade Stalin

663
32:14.170 --> 32:17.170
agrees with our expansion to the northwest and north,

664
32:17.440 --> 32:19.680
and does not oppose us getting closer to the Soviet Union.

665
32:19.680 --> 32:21.410
Therefore, he and some comrades advocate

666
32:21.410 --> 32:24.210
that our Red Army should rapidly expand westward,

667
32:25.160 --> 32:26.290
through Ningxia

668
32:28.030 --> 32:29.350
toward Outer Mongolia,

669
32:29.350 --> 32:30.850
and establish a base there

670
32:31.400 --> 32:34.740
to obtain technical assistance from the Soviet Union.

671
32:36.510 --> 32:37.880
What do you think?

672
32:39.480 --> 32:40.880
I agree with this policy.

673
32:42.200 --> 32:43.760
But now is not the time.

674
32:44.310 --> 32:45.440
In addition,

675
32:45.710 --> 32:48.230
the route and direction of the march

676
32:48.510 --> 32:50.170
need to be discussed further.

677
33:00.800 --> 33:06.620
[1st Front Red Army Garrison, Ganquan County, Shaanxi]

678
33:04.110 --> 33:04.750
Mr. Sun,

679
33:04.770 --> 33:05.270
out herding sheep?

680
33:05.270 --> 33:06.470
Hello, Comrade Peng.

681
33:15.970 --> 33:19.380
Mrs. Wang sits in her northern room,

682
33:19.550 --> 33:21.720
longing for her love.

683
33:21.790 --> 33:23.320
He seems to be in a good mood.

684
33:24.110 --> 33:25.310
He has quite a temper.

685
33:25.510 --> 33:26.980
When the Medic changed his dressing this morning,

686
33:26.980 --> 33:28.980
he even kicked over the medical kit.

687
33:56.070 --> 33:57.310
Today is not bad.

688
33:58.070 --> 33:59.220
There's wine and food,

689
33:59.220 --> 34:01.020
and a new cotton-padded jacket.

690
34:01.550 --> 34:02.280
What's this?

691
34:02.350 --> 34:03.640
A last meal?

692
34:04.370 --> 34:05.880
Getting ready to send me off to my death?

693
34:05.880 --> 34:07.810
I knew you couldn't keep up the act.

694
34:08.020 --> 34:09.219
You guys go out first.

695
34:15.190 --> 34:16.400
It's not a last meal.

696
34:16.800 --> 34:18.420
These are all our spoils of war.

697
34:18.420 --> 34:20.670
Isn't this still the food of our Northeastern Army?

698
34:20.670 --> 34:21.840
Not just your food.

699
34:21.860 --> 34:23.639
We also captured many of your men.

700
34:23.639 --> 34:24.639
Let me inform you,

701
34:25.400 --> 34:27.110
we just wiped out Niu Yuanfeng's 109th Division

702
34:27.110 --> 34:29.840
and the 617th Regiment

703
34:30.000 --> 34:32.840
of the 106th Division

704
34:32.860 --> 34:34.050
at Zhiluo Town.

705
34:35.610 --> 34:36.429
Who are you?

706
34:37.920 --> 34:40.440
I am Peng Dehuai,

707
34:40.590 --> 34:42.710
Commander of the 1st Front Red Army

708
34:42.840 --> 34:43.840
of the Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army.

709
34:43.550 --> 34:46.199
[Gao Fuyuan, Former Commander of the 619th Regiment, 107th Division, 67th Army of the Northeastern Army]

710
34:47.030 --> 34:48.690
To be able to meet Commander Peng

711
34:48.690 --> 34:50.330
is my honor.

712
34:51.070 --> 34:52.199
Let's speak openly.

713
34:53.150 --> 34:54.750
Since the day I was captured,

714
34:55.120 --> 34:57.040
I never planned to get out alive.

715
34:57.920 --> 34:59.320
Kill me or torture me,

716
34:59.440 --> 35:00.670
do as you please.

717
35:01.550 --> 35:03.190
But let me tell you,

718
35:03.630 --> 35:05.680
I, Gao Fuyuan, am an upright man.

719
35:06.440 --> 35:08.030
If you want me to surrender,

720
35:08.110 --> 35:09.770
it's absolutely impossible.

721
35:12.510 --> 35:13.840
I'm not here

722
35:13.960 --> 35:15.400
to kill you,

723
35:15.810 --> 35:17.410
nor am I here to persuade you.

724
35:18.030 --> 35:19.590
I just want to chat with you.

725
35:20.880 --> 35:22.540
What do you want to chat about?

726
35:22.760 --> 35:24.030
Let's chat about

727
35:24.150 --> 35:26.280
whether it's worth having the Northeastern Army

728
35:26.280 --> 35:27.840
and the Red Army fight each other.

729
35:27.840 --> 35:29.080
Let's chat about

730
35:30.180 --> 35:33.850
who benefits, and who suffers,

731
35:34.320 --> 35:36.800
when both sides are left battered?

732
35:38.070 --> 35:41.550
The Red Army came to Northern Shaanxi after the Long March,

733
35:42.150 --> 35:44.800
not to fight for territory with Northeastern Army.

734
35:44.800 --> 35:46.030
Going north to resist Japan

735
35:46.030 --> 35:48.360
is the banner our Red Army raised long ago.

736
35:48.840 --> 35:50.510
But what about Chiang Kai-shek?

737
35:50.510 --> 35:52.150
He plays dumb

738
35:52.510 --> 35:54.110
and encircles and suppresses us all the way.

739
35:54.110 --> 35:56.400
There's a saying you're surely familiar with:

740
35:56.400 --> 35:58.260
"Set the tiger against the wolf."

741
35:58.840 --> 35:59.640
Along the way,

742
36:00.290 --> 36:02.600
he's swallowed Guizhou

743
36:02.940 --> 36:05.380
and brought Sichuan under his control.

744
36:05.800 --> 36:08.880
It's only a matter of time before he takes Guangdong, Guangxi, and Yunnan.

745
36:08.880 --> 36:11.100
Now that we've reached northern Shaanxi,

746
36:11.100 --> 36:14.100
his Central Army is keeping its distance,

747
36:14.330 --> 36:17.250
while he sends your Northeastern Army to fight us.

748
36:17.390 --> 36:19.710
So who is he trying to devour this time?

749
36:20.320 --> 36:21.780
I don't need to say it, do I?

750
36:25.710 --> 36:27.280
Whether it's the Northeastern Army

751
36:27.280 --> 36:28.320
or the Red Army,

752
36:28.650 --> 36:30.310
if we keep fighting like this,

753
36:30.550 --> 36:31.960
there's only one outcome:

754
36:31.960 --> 36:33.670
we'll both end up battered.

755
36:34.360 --> 36:35.490
When the time comes,

756
36:35.920 --> 36:37.690
we'll both be fighting each other,

757
36:37.690 --> 36:40.090
and Chiang Kai-shek will reap the rewards.

758
36:40.830 --> 36:43.550
He'll get rid of the Red Army

759
36:44.290 --> 36:45.820
and the Northeastern Army,

760
36:46.110 --> 36:48.440
which isn't under his direct command.

761
36:48.710 --> 36:50.230
He couldn't be happier.

762
36:50.730 --> 36:54.400
Of course, there are people who are even happier.

763
36:59.590 --> 37:01.520
The ones occupying the Northeast,

764
37:03.000 --> 37:03.800
the Japanese.

765
37:19.350 --> 37:20.480
We have learned that

766
37:20.770 --> 37:22.700
most men in your Northeastern Army

767
37:22.990 --> 37:24.320
have national pride and

768
37:24.710 --> 37:26.710
refuse to live

769
37:27.150 --> 37:28.280
under foreign rule.

770
37:28.820 --> 37:30.410
You, Gao Fuyuan, are one of them.

771
37:30.410 --> 37:31.880
Your commander, Wang Yizhe,

772
37:31.880 --> 37:33.610
should also be considered one.

773
37:34.400 --> 37:36.460
Actually, you don't want to fight us.

774
37:36.580 --> 37:38.780
You were forced by Chiang Kai-shek.

775
37:39.060 --> 37:40.580
What you really want is

776
37:40.820 --> 37:43.500
to fight your way back to the Northeast one day,

777
37:44.360 --> 37:46.400
drive all those Japanese out,

778
37:46.870 --> 37:50.270
and give an answer to your fellow villagers in the Northeast.

779
37:56.260 --> 37:57.060
Yes.

780
37:58.680 --> 38:00.150
We dream of it.

781
38:02.030 --> 38:03.990
Even if we have to lose our lives,

782
38:04.510 --> 38:06.570
we want to lose them in the Northeast.

783
38:06.850 --> 38:08.480
Who wants to die here?

784
38:08.790 --> 38:09.940
So,

785
38:11.220 --> 38:13.890
if we fight here and both suffer,

786
38:13.960 --> 38:15.550
there will be fewer and fewer Chinese

787
38:15.550 --> 38:17.230
who want to resist Japan.

788
38:17.480 --> 38:19.150
The Japanese will naturally be even happier.

789
38:19.150 --> 38:20.360
Make them happy?

790
38:20.510 --> 38:21.380
No way!

791
38:25.450 --> 38:26.980
I didn't come in vain today.

792
38:27.210 --> 38:29.320
You know all this perfectly well.

793
38:31.850 --> 38:33.380
Everything you said today,

794
38:34.270 --> 38:36.000
I have understood completely.

795
38:36.140 --> 38:37.420
Frankly speaking,

796
38:38.130 --> 38:40.150
you've said exactly what's in my heart.

797
38:40.150 --> 38:41.810
As an old Chinese saying goes,

798
38:41.810 --> 38:43.470
brothers may fight among themselves,

799
38:43.470 --> 38:46.000
but they must unite against outside enemies.

800
38:46.000 --> 38:47.660
I understand this principle.

801
38:48.010 --> 38:49.540
But I have one more request.

802
38:49.580 --> 38:50.370
Speak.

803
38:51.860 --> 38:53.390
I'll take your word for now.

804
38:53.770 --> 38:55.210
I want to see for myself

805
38:55.500 --> 38:57.100
whether your Red Army is truly

806
38:57.100 --> 38:59.160
committed to fighting the Japanese.

807
39:01.210 --> 39:02.670
Hearing is not believing.

808
39:02.880 --> 39:03.920
We welcome you.

809
39:04.960 --> 39:06.770
You can look wherever you want.

810
39:07.330 --> 39:08.190
If I have time,

811
39:08.480 --> 39:09.650
I will accompany you.

812
39:09.650 --> 39:10.400
Of course,

813
39:10.550 --> 39:12.970
you can also walk around and see for yourself.

814
39:12.970 --> 39:14.370
Seeing is believing.

815
39:20.490 --> 39:21.660
Commander Peng,

816
39:23.080 --> 39:24.740
thank you for your trust in me.

817
39:27.790 --> 39:29.910
Our Red Army has no commanders.

818
39:30.420 --> 39:31.900
Officers and soldiers are equal.

819
39:31.900 --> 39:33.700
You can just call me Peng Dehuai.

820
39:34.630 --> 39:36.790
I am a few years older than you.

821
39:37.850 --> 39:39.960
You can also call me brother.

822
39:45.390 --> 39:48.860
[Northwest Bandit-Suppression Headquarters, Xi'an, Shaanxi]

823
39:52.550 --> 39:53.400
Commander.

824
39:54.550 --> 39:55.400
Dong Yingbin,

825
39:55.800 --> 39:57.230
how dare you!

826
39:57.510 --> 39:58.320
Guards!

827
39:58.800 --> 40:00.510
Take him away and lock him up for 15 days.

828
40:00.510 --> 40:01.300
Give him only water,

829
40:01.300 --> 40:02.070
no food.

830
40:02.090 --> 40:03.020
What's going on?

831
40:03.160 --> 40:03.880
Commander.

832
40:04.030 --> 40:05.000
What's going on?

833
40:05.230 --> 40:06.280
Commander, let me speak.

834
40:06.280 --> 40:07.420
Let me speak.

835
40:07.450 --> 40:08.450
Let him speak.

836
40:11.460 --> 40:12.340
Commander.

837
40:12.450 --> 40:14.800
[Dong Yingbin, Acting Commander of the 57th Army of the Northeastern Army]

838
40:13.170 --> 40:14.700
We lost the 109th Division,

839
40:15.360 --> 40:17.320
but surely that's no reason to put me to death.

840
40:17.320 --> 40:18.530
If I hadn't ordered the 111th Division

841
40:18.530 --> 40:20.030
and the 106th Division to retreat,

842
40:20.030 --> 40:22.000
the entire 57th Army would have been wiped out.

843
40:22.000 --> 40:23.890
Advancing east without authorization,

844
40:23.890 --> 40:25.440
shooting you is letting you off easy.

845
40:25.440 --> 40:26.760
Without authorization?

846
40:26.760 --> 40:27.440
Commander.

847
40:27.920 --> 40:29.550
I didn't deploy troops without authorization.

848
40:29.550 --> 40:30.400
I was following

849
40:30.400 --> 40:32.110
the orders from you and Generalissimo Chiang.

850
40:32.110 --> 40:32.920
What orders?

851
40:33.030 --> 40:34.440
The orders you and Generalissimo Chiang

852
40:34.440 --> 40:35.880
jointly signed.

853
40:36.030 --> 40:38.230
Yan Daogang rushed to Taibai Town overnight to deliver it.

854
40:38.230 --> 40:39.360
I was still worried,

855
40:39.390 --> 40:41.000
so I specifically told Niu Yuanfeng

856
40:41.000 --> 40:42.280
to advance steadily.

857
40:42.300 --> 40:44.360
But that bastard didn't listen to me.

858
40:44.400 --> 40:46.200
Where is the handwritten order?

859
40:47.150 --> 40:47.880
Go get it!

860
40:48.320 --> 40:48.900
Yes.

861
40:56.200 --> 40:58.020
My sworn brother,

862
40:59.980 --> 41:01.950
you've played me again.

863
41:05.730 --> 41:06.880
While the Chiang Kai-shek government

864
41:06.880 --> 41:10.000
was doing its utmost to encircle and suppress the Red Army,

865
41:10.000 --> 41:12.440
its extreme compromise with the Japanese aggressors

866
41:12.440 --> 41:14.570
was also proceeding simultaneously.

867
41:14.970 --> 41:17.900
Since the signing of the He-Umezu Agreement in July,

868
41:17.910 --> 41:20.110
Japanese Foreign Minister Koki Hirota

869
41:20.150 --> 41:22.980
proposed in October the notorious

870
41:23.130 --> 41:24.730
Three Principles of Hirota.

871
41:25.440 --> 41:28.800
They demanded that China completely suppress anti-Japanese activities,

872
41:28.800 --> 41:30.460
adopt a pro-Japanese policy,

873
41:30.800 --> 41:33.050
[Joint Suppression of Communism]

874
41:30.980 --> 41:32.420
recognize Manchukuo,

875
41:32.500 --> 41:33.670
realize economic and promote economic cooperation

876
41:33.490 --> 41:42.070
[Pro-Japanese Policy]

877
41:33.690 --> 41:36.360
among China, Japan, and Manchukuo in North China,

878
41:36.360 --> 41:39.150
and have the Nationalist government and Manchukuo

879
41:39.150 --> 41:41.030
jointly oppose communism.

880
41:41.230 --> 41:42.360
At the same time,

881
41:42.670 --> 41:44.360
Japan's scheme to establish autonomy

882
41:44.360 --> 41:48.090
in the five northern Chinese provinces grew increasingly brazen.

883
41:48.270 --> 41:49.900
On November 11,

884
41:50.190 --> 41:52.370
the head of the Japanese Kwantung Army's special service agency,

885
41:52.370 --> 41:53.710
Kenji Doihara,

886
41:53.870 --> 41:56.260
presented to the Commander of the Kuomintang's 29th Army

887
41:56.260 --> 41:59.460
and Peiping and Tianjin Garrison Commander, Song Zheyuan,

888
41:59.460 --> 42:01.710
the Plan for a High Degree of Autonomy in North China,

889
42:01.710 --> 42:03.970
and demanded a reply within a time limit.

890
42:04.570 --> 42:07.300
The entire North China was in imminent danger.

891
42:07.620 --> 42:12.680
[Nanjing, Jiangsu]

892
42:08.320 --> 42:09.360
Mr. Ariyoshi.

893
42:10.210 --> 42:12.920
The Generalissimo has other affairs to attend to.

894
42:12.920 --> 42:13.880
He instructed me

895
42:14.070 --> 42:15.350
to talk with you.

896
42:15.800 --> 42:16.750
If you have anything to say,

897
42:16.750 --> 42:18.300
I can pass it on.

898
42:20.260 --> 42:24.410
I'm afraid the Generalissimo doesn't want to see me

899
42:24.440 --> 42:26.010
and is just making excuses.

900
42:27.700 --> 42:30.050
Whether to see you or not is the Generalissimo's business.

901
42:29.930 --> 42:32.790
[Qian Dajun, Director of the First Department, Chairman's Office, Military Affairs Commission of the Nationalist Government]

902
42:30.320 --> 42:33.070
Whether you believe it or not is your business.

903
42:33.230 --> 42:35.760
Then please tell Generalissimo Chiang.

904
42:35.810 --> 42:37.510
[Akiyoshi Arikichi, Japanese Ambassador to China]

905
42:36.030 --> 42:37.710
In my opinion,

906
42:37.960 --> 42:40.190
unless the Chinese government

907
42:40.360 --> 42:41.670
takes swift action in response to

908
42:41.670 --> 42:44.550
the situation in North China,

909
42:44.760 --> 42:45.840
the crisis there

910
42:45.840 --> 42:48.590
will only worsen.

911
42:48.840 --> 42:50.710
We still insist on one principle.

912
42:51.320 --> 42:54.480
That is, if any problems arise between China and Japan,

913
42:54.590 --> 42:57.480
the Japanese side must negotiate with the Nationalist Government,

914
42:57.480 --> 42:59.960
not with the local authorities.

915
43:00.150 --> 43:03.190
The local authorities cannot represent the Nationalist Government.
